    "UIName": "Hephaestus D",
    "Id": "vehicledef_HEPHAESTUS_ST_D",
    "Name": "Hephaestus D",
    "Details": "The Hephaestus Scout Tank is an OmniVehicle produced exclusively by Clan Hell's Horses. All variants of the Hephaestus incorporate a sizable infantry bay as well as an Active Probe to locate hidden units. The D configuration introduced in 3071 carries a pair of ER Medium Lasers in the turret, backed by a pair of AP Gauss Rifles. It carries the expected Active Probe in the hull, along with an ECM Suite. An expanded five ton infantry bay is also provided.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 8/12 hexes / 240/360 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous (C)\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       100     15\n<b>Left</b>         100     15\n<b>Right</b>       100     15\n<b>Rear</b>         95     15\n<b>Turret</b>      100     15\n\n<b>Total</b>      495     75</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Missile Jammer</color>\n\n<color=#ffcc00> Omni Vehicle</color>\n\n<color=#ffcc00> Can carry 1 Battle Armor Squads. Has firing ports.</color>",
    "Icon": "Hadur"
  },
